        complexity: { best: 'the constant power region extends the speed range without a gearbox', avg: 'speed ratios of three to four are practical', worst: 'at high speed the breakdown torque envelope cuts the available torque below the constant power value', note: 'The breakdown limit produces a third region of operation not present in the direct current machine.' },
