        code: { lang: 'text', src: 'Four machine types, four different wins:\n\n            eff  density cost robust speed  control  converter\n  DC        low  low     med  LOW    ~2     SIMPLEST standard\n  INDUCTION med  med     LOW  HIGH   3-4    complex  STANDARD\n  PM BLDC   BEST BEST    high med    med    complex  STANDARD\n  SRM       med  med     BEST BEST   WIDEST complex  special\n\nNo machine leads on EVERY criterion.\n\nSelection follows APPLICATION PRIORITY:\n  low cost urban vehicle   -> SRM or induction\n  premium long range       -> interior PM\n  (range is its selling point, so it can absorb\n   the magnet cost)\n\nThe survival of all four in production is EVIDENCE\nthat the criteria genuinely conflict.\n\nSOURCE: TB1 Ch.6, pp.141-226.' },
