          'Cap the tractive effort demand at the tyre adhesion limit',
          'Convert the requirement into a torque-speed envelope through a trial gear ratio',
          'Select a machine whose envelope, speed ratio and efficiency map all suit',
          'Design the control structure that delivers commanded torque across that envelope',
