        complexity: { best: 'a well matched machine satisfies every criterion with margin', avg: 'the gear ratio and machine choice are decided together rather than in sequence', worst: 'conflicting requirements force either a second gear ratio or an oversized machine', note: 'The chain has a feedback path: the machine speed ratio affects the gear ratio decision and vice versa.' },
